#!args apps/JFDiagrammer/tests/jd16-schablone.vsx --no-system-fonts
# JFDiagrammer, JD16: a stencil in Visio's XML format of 2003-2010 (DF-20; jd16-schablone.vsx is
# diagramiotest's self-written file, --write-vdx) named on the command line goes into the Shapes
# panel as a stencil: its three masters as tiles; a click on a tile and one on the page place it
expect tab:"jd16-schablone" selected
expect button:"Kasten" exists
expect button:"Kreis" exists
expect button:"Pfeil" exists
expect text:"Keine Schablone geöffnet." missing
click button:"Kreis"
expect button:"Kreis" checked
click canvas:"Zeichenfläche"
a11y expect announced "„Kreis“ abgelegt"
expect listitem:"Kreis" exists
